        "Name": "Hatchetman",
        "Details": "<i>Bageleman</i> is the personal customized <i>Hatchetman</i> of legendary Pirate and Black Marketeer Bastion 'Bagele' Agele.  He constructed it with whatever was available from other 'Mechs that he could salvage. A bevy of pirate lasers provide backup to what looks like part of a Raven welded in to its torso. The addition of a TSM turns this hot-running pirate mech into a deadly killing machine.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Melee Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>",
